oreground/40 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary border border-border text-foreground font-mono font-semibold text-sm">2</div><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold">Skip the infrastructure work</h3></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-3">Leave proxy rotation, JavaScript rendering, and CAPTCHA solving to us.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">proxies</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">rendering</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">CAPTCHAs</span></div></div><div class="relative p-5 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary border border-border text-foreground font-mono font-semibold text-sm">3</div><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold">Get data in the format you need</h3></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-3">Choose HTML, Markdown, plain text, or a screenshot.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">html</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">markdown</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">text</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 font-mono border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">screenshot</span></div></div></div><div class="w-full"><div class="flex justify-end pr-2 md:pr-6 mb-1 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex items-end gap-1"><p class="caveat_bef3c61d-module__ubF6Ea__className text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight text-center -rotate-3">Watch the video to see<br/>exactly how it works</p><svg width="58" height="50" viewBox="0 0 70 60" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-shrink-0 translate-y-3"><path d="M4 8c30-10 58 2 56 38"></path><path d="M52 38l8 9 9-7"></path></svg></div></div><div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><button type="button" class="group relative block w-full aspect-video" aria-label="Play video: ScrapeBadger Getting Started: Scrape Twitter, Reddit &amp; Google in 90 Seconds"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HCcEqp4sW48/maxresdefault.jpg" alt="ScrapeBadger Getting Started: Scrape Twitter, Reddit &amp; Google in 90 Seconds" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/30 transition-colors group-hover:bg-black/20"><span class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transition-transform group-hover:scale-105"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play h-7 w-7 text-primary-foreground fill-current ml-1"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span></span></button></div></div></div><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 bg-card border border-border rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground flex-1"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Use it from Claude:</span> <!-- -->add our MCP connector and scrape by just asking.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-mono text-foreground border border-border rounded hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" aria-label="Copy https://mcp.scrapebadger.com/mcp">mcp.scrapebadger.com/mcp<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-3 w-3 text-muted-foreground"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:translate-y-px border border-border bg-transparent text-foreground hover:bg-secondary h-8 px-3 text-xs" href="/mcp">Set up MCP</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border bg-card"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-4 text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">Find the right API for <span class="text-primary">the type of data you need.</span></h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">Choose a category to explore the sources and fields available for your workflow.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><a class="group p-5 bg-background border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" href="/scrapers?category=ecommerce"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shopping-cart h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><circle cx="8" cy="21" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1"></circle><path d="M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold flex-1">E-commerce</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Product details, prices, offers, and reviews.</p></a><a class="group p-5 bg-background border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" href="/scrapers?category=social-media"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold flex-1">Social Media</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Public posts, profiles, comments, and engagement.</p></a><a class="group p-5 bg-background border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" href="/scrapers?category=serp"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold flex-1">Search Engines</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Web results for search and competitor research.</p></a><a class="group p-5 bg-background border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" href="/scrapers?category=google"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold flex-1">Google</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Search, Maps, Shopping, News, Trends, and more.</p></a><a class="group p-5 bg-background border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" href="/scrapers?category=real-estate"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-house h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"></path><path d="M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold flex-1">Real Estate</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Property listings, asking prices, and details.</p></a><a class="group p-5 bg-background border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors" href="/scrapers?category=llm"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><div class="w-9 h-9 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold flex-1">LLMs</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Generated responses, brand mentions, and citations.</p></a></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4"><a class="text-sm text-primary hover:underline" href="/scrapers">Browse all categories →</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-9 px-4 py-2" href="/auth/signup">Sign up<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border bg-card"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-4 text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">The Web Fights Back. <span class="text-primary">We Fight Harder.</span></h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">Modern websites deploy layers of protection to block scrapers. Building and maintaining your own bypass infrastructure is a full-time job. We do it for you.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-12"><div class="p-5 bg-background border border-destructive/20 hover:border-destructive/40 transition-colors"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-destructive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert h-5 w-5 text-destructive"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5 normal-case">CAPTCHAs</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">reCAPTCHA, hCaptcha, Turnstile: invisible and visual challenges that stop automated requests cold.</p></div><div class="p-5 bg-background border border-destructive/20 hover:border-destructive/40 transition-colors"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-destructive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ban h-5 w-5 text-destructive"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5 normal-case">WAFs &amp; CDNs</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Web application firewalls fingerprint your requests and block anything that looks non-human.</p></div><div class="p-5 bg-background border border-destructive/20 hover:border-destructive/40 transition-colors"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-destructive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-fingerprint h-5 w-5 text-destructive"><path d="M12 10a2 2 0 0 0-2 2c0 1.02-.1 2.51-.26 4"></path><path d="M14 13.12c0 2.38 0 6.38-1 8.88"></path><path d="M17.29 21.02c.12-.6.43-2.3.5-3.02"></path><path d="M2 12a10 10 0 0 1 18-6"></path><path d="M2 16h.01"></path><path d="M21.8 16c.2-2 .131-5.354 0-6"></path><path d="M5 19.5C5.5 18 6 15 6 12a6 6 0 0 1 .34-2"></path><path d="M8.65 22c.21-.66.45-1.32.57-2"></path><path d="M9 6.8a6 6 0 0 1 9 5.2v2"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5 normal-case">Browser Fingerprinting</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Sites analyze canvas, WebGL, fonts, and dozens of signals to detect headless browsers.</p></div><div class="p-5 bg-background border border-destructive/20 hover:border-destructive/40 transition-colors"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-destructive/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye h-5 w-5 text-destructive"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5 normal-case">AI Behavioral Detection</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Machine learning models analyze mouse movements, timing patterns, and navigation behavior.</p></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto p-6 md:p-8 border border-border bg-card"><div class="text-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot h-8 w-8 text-muted-foreground mx-auto mb-3"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold mb-2">ScrapeBadger handles all of this automatically</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Send a URL, get clean structured content. No proxy setup, no CAPTCHA solving, no browser management.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground">Residential proxy rotation across 150+ countries</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground">Real browser sessions with human-like fingerprints</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground">Automatic CAPTCHA solving and challenge bypass</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground">Smart engine escalation when sites fight back</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground">AI-powered data extraction from any page</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-foreground">Clean output in HTML, Markdown, or plain text</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-4 text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">Built to bypass the toughest <span class="text-primary">anti-bot systems</span></h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">Modern websites deploy sophisticated bot detection that silently blocks scrapers without returning an error. ScrapeBadger&#x27;s auto-escalation engine identifies which protection a target uses and selects the right bypass method. You configure nothing.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-10"><a aria-label="Read more about bypassing Cloudflare" class="group block p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all rounded-lg" href="/cloudflare-bypass"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-foreground">CF</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Cloudflare</h3></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Cloudflare protects a large portion of the web with browser challenges, JS fingerprinting, and Turnstile CAPTCHAs. ScrapeBadger bypasses Cloudflare&#x27;s bot management including under-attack mode, challenge pages, and the newest WAF rules, without requiring any configuration from you.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary transition-colors">Read more →</span></a><a aria-label="Read more about bypassing DataDome" class="group block p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all rounded-lg" href="/datadome-bypass"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-foreground">DD</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">DataDome</h3></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">DataDome uses real-time behavioral analysis and device fingerprinting to block automated requests. It&#x27;s common on fashion, retail, and media sites. ScrapeBadger passes DataDome&#x27;s behavioral checks by emulating real browser interaction patterns, HTTP headers, and TLS fingerprints.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary transition-colors">Read more →</span></a><a aria-label="Read more about bypassing Akamai Bot Manager" class="group block p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all rounded-lg" href="/akamai-bypass"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-foreground">AK</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Akamai Bot Manager</h3></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Akamai Bot Manager is deployed by banks, airlines, and large enterprises. It uses JavaScript sensor data collection and behavioral scoring to detect automation. ScrapeBadger handles Akamai&#x27;s sensor challenges and maintains consistent browser identity across requests to avoid triggering risk scores.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary transition-colors">Read more →</span></a><a aria-label="Read more about bypassing Imperva" class="group block p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all rounded-lg" href="/imperva-bypass"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-foreground">IV</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Imperva</h3></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Imperva (formerly Incapsula) combines IP reputation, cookie challenges, and JavaScript fingerprinting. It&#x27;s widely used on financial and government sites. ScrapeBadger passes Imperva&#x27;s cookie-based challenges and IP scoring by routing through clean residential IPs with valid browser profiles.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary transition-colors">Read more →</span></a><a aria-label="Read more about bypassing PerimeterX" class="group block p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all rounded-lg" href="/perimeterx-bypass"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-foreground">PX</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">PerimeterX</h3></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">PerimeterX (now HUMAN Security) scores every request in real time using mouse movements, timing data, and browser telemetry. ScrapeBadger&#x27;s stealth browser generates realistic interaction patterns and telemetry that pass PerimeterX&#x27;s risk scoring without triggering blocks or CAPTCHAs.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary transition-colors">Read more →</span></a><a aria-label="Read more about bypassing Kasada" class="group block p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all rounded-lg" href="/kasada-bypass"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-foreground">KS</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Kasada</h3></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Kasada is used by high-security platforms including ticketing sites and sneaker retailers. It deploys cryptographic interrogation that detects automation at the TLS handshake level. ScrapeBadger overcomes Kasada&#x27;s client-side challenges using a fully instrumented browser environment that passes all interrogation checks.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary transition-colors">Read more →</span></a></div><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center p-5 bg-card border border-border rounded-lg"><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">ScrapeBadger continuously monitors and updates bypass methods as detection systems evolve. When a protection changes, our infrastructure adapts, and your scraping jobs keep running without any changes on your end.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-4 text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">Trusted by <span class="text-primary">developers</span></h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8"><a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6abc82e49c3e75f45c2a1abb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex flex-col p-6 bg-card border border-border rounded-lg hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-colors"><div class="flex mb-3" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star h-4 w-4 text-warning fill-warning"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke