y-0.5 border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">JSON</span></div></div><div class="group p-5 md:p-6 bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all cursor-default flex flex-col"><div class="w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-3 md:mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5 md:h-6 md:w-6 text-muted-foreground"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-semibold mb-2">Lead Generation</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-3 flex-1">Build prospect lists from public directories, social profiles, and business listings, at scale.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-auto"><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">Directories</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">Profiles</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 border border-border bg-secondary/50 text-muted-foreground">Business listings</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover opacity-25" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-proxy-globe.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-proxy-globe.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-proxy-globe.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-proxy-globe.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 108