="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground mx-auto mb-2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Auto-rotation</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Fresh IP on every request. No sticky sessions to manage.</p></div><div class="p-4 bg-card border border-border text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground mx-auto mb-2"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Residential IPs</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Real residential IPs from ISPs worldwide. Not datacenter.</p></div><div class="p-4 bg-card border border-border text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground mx-auto mb-2"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Geo-targeting</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Target by country with a single parameter. ISP and city-level available.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="text-center mb-6 md:mb-10"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-4 text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">Simple, <span class="text-primary">transparent pricing</span></h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">Pay As You Go from $10 or save up to 70% with a monthly/annual subscription. Subscription credits refresh monthly; PAYG credits never expire.</p></div><!--$?--><template id="B:1"></template><div class="h-96"></div><!--/$--><div class="text-center mt-6"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/pricing">See full pricing details<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border bg-card" id="faq"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-4 text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">Frequently asked <span class="text-primary">questions</span></h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground">Everything you need to know about ScrapeBadger&#x27;s web scraping API.</p></div><div class="border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 border-b border-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">What is a web scraping API?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">A web scraping API is a service that lets you extract data from any website with a single HTTP request, without building or maintaining your own scraping infrastructure. ScrapeBadger handles proxy rotation, JavaScript rendering, anti-bot bypass, and session management automatically.</div></details><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 border-b border-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Which anti-bot systems does ScrapeBadger bypass?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">ScrapeBadger bypasses Cloudflare, DataDome, Akamai Bot Manager, Imperva (Incapsula), PerimeterX, and Kasada automatically. It also solves reCAPTCHA v2 and v3, hCaptcha, and Cloudflare Turnstile.</div></details><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 border-b border-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">How does ScrapeBadger handle JavaScript-heavy websites?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">ScrapeBadger renders pages in a stealth Chromium browser (Patchright) that passes fingerprinting checks. Set render_js: true in your request to get the fully rendered DOM.</div></details><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 border-b border-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">What output formats does the web scraping API return?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">ScrapeBadger returns HTML, Markdown, plain text, and screenshot (PNG). Set the format parameter to html, markdown, text, or screenshot.</div></details><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 border-b border-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">How is pricing calculated?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">ScrapeBadger uses a credit-based model. Pay As You Go from $10 ($0.15 per 1,000 credits; PAYG credits never expire) or save up to 70% with a monthly/annual subscription (Starter, Growth, Pro, Scale, Volume, Max). 1,000 free credits on signup, no credit card required.</div></details><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 border-b border-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Is web scraping legal?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Scraping publicly accessible data is generally considered legal. A 2022 US Ninth Circuit ruling (hiQ v. LinkedIn) affirmed scraping public data does not violate the CFAA. Always check a site&#x27;s robots.txt and ToS.</div></details><details class="group bg-card open:bg-card/80 "><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-card/80 transition-colors"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Is there a free trial?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Yes. Every new account receives 1,000 free credits on signup with no credit card required.</div></details></div></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-border bg-card"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-10"><div><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-foreground font-display font-bold tracking-tight">Latest tutorials <span class="text-primary">&amp; updates</span></h2></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/blog">View all posts<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><a class="group bg-card border border-border hover:border-muted-foreground/40 transition-all flex flex-col overflow-hidden" href="/blog/web-scraping-statistics"><div class="relative aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden bg-muted"><img alt="Web Scraping Statistics 2026" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fblog%2Ffd172a6f-e28e-4ee0-bc4f-8e7ee0197227.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fblog%2Ffd172a6f-e28e-4ee0-bc4f-8e7ee0197227.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fblog%2Ffd172a6f-e28e-4ee0-bc4f-8e7ee0197227.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fblog%2Ffd172a6f-e28e-4ee0-bc4f-8e7ee0197227.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fblog%2Ffd172a6f-e28e-4ee0-bc4f-8e7ee0197227.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fblog%2Ffd172a6f-e28e-4ee0-bc4f-8e7ee0197227.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /