et the fully rendered DOM.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What output formats does the web scraping API return?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ScrapeBadger returns HTML, Markdown, plain text, and screenshot (PNG). Set the format parameter to html, markdown, text, or screenshot.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is pricing calculated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ScrapeBadger uses a credit-based model. Pay As You Go from $10 ($0.15 per 1,000 credits; PAYG credits never expire) or save up to 70% with a monthly/annual subscription (Starter, Growth, Pro, Scale, Volume, Max). 1,000 free credits on signup, no credit card required.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is web scraping legal?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Scraping publicly accessible data is generally considered legal. A 2022 US Ninth Circuit ruling (hiQ v. LinkedIn) affirmed scraping public data does not violate the CFAA. Always check a site's robots.txt and ToS.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there a free trial?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Every new account receives 1,000 free credits on signup with no credit card required.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"15:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"ScrapeBadger\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://scrapebadger.com\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"https://scrapebadger.com/logo.png\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Scrape any website with auto-escalation and anti-bot bypass. Clean HTML, Markdown, or screenshots delivered via a simple API.\\\",\\\"sameAs\\\":[\\\"https://x.com/scrapebadger\\\",\\\"https://github.com/scrape-badger\\\",\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/scrapebadger\\\",\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@scrapebadger\\\"],\\\"contactPoint\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ContactPoint\\