 no blocks scraping, Cloudflare bypass\",\"social_description\":\"Scrape any website and get clean data back. Auto-escalation handles anti-bot protection. HTML, Markdown, Text, Screenshots.\",\"og_image_alt\":\"ScrapeBadger - Scrape Any Website\",\"organization_description\":\"Scrape any website with auto-escalation and anti-bot bypass. Clean HTML, Markdown, or screenshots delivered via a simple API.\"},\"announcement\":{\"price_update_label\":\"Price update:\",\"price_update_one_on\":\"{count} API price change on {date}\",\"price_update_one_starting\":\"{count} API price change starting {date}\",\"price_update_other_on\":\"{count} API prices change on {date}\",\"price_update_other_starting\":\"{count} API prices change starting {date}\",\"see_new_prices\":\"See new prices\",\"launch_title\":\"Pricing update:\",\"launch_body\":\"new credit costs in effect since October 15\",\"launch_cta\":\"Read more\"},\"header\":{\"tagline\":\"Your trusted web scraping partner\",\"products\":\"Products\",\"dedicated_apis\":\"Dedicated Scraper APIs\",\"dedicated\":{\"google\":\"Google Scraper API\",\"twitter\":\"Twitter Scraper API\",\"ecommerce\":\"Ecommerce Scraper API\",\"reddit\":\"Reddit Scraper API\",\"ebay\":\"eBay Scraper API\",\"amazon\":\"Amazon Scraper API\",\"vinted\":\"Vinted Scraper API\",\"chatgpt\":\"ChatGPT Scraper API\",\"gemini\":\"Gemini Scraper API\"},\"view_all\":\"View All\",\"types\":\"Types\",\"developers\":\"Developers\",\"developer_items\":{\"docs\":{\"label\":\"Documentation\",\"description\":\"API reference, guides \u0026 tutorials\"},\"sdks\":{\"label\":\"SDKs\",\"description\":\"Official client libraries for 12 languages\"},\"mcp\":{\"label\":\"MCP Server\",\"description\":\"Connect AI agents via Model Context Protocol\"},\"cli\":{\"label\":\"CLI\",\"description\":\"Command-line tool for scripting \u0026 pipelines\"}},\"nav\":{\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"whats_new\":\"What's New\",\"contact\":\"Contact\"},\"dashboard\":\"Dashboard\",\"login\":\"Login\",\"get_started\":\"Get Started\",\"sign_out\":\"Sign Out\",\"ask_ai\":\"Ask AI\",\"open_ai_assistant\":\"Open AI assistant\",\"join_discord\":\"Join our Discord\",\"join_discord_server\":\"Join our Discord server\",\"open_menu\":\"Open navigation menu\",\"close_menu\":\"Close navigation menu\"},\"categories\":{\"ecommerce\":\"E-commerce\",\"social-media\":\"Social Media\",\"serp\":\"Search Engines\",\"google\":\"Google\",\"real-estate\":\"Real Estate\",\"llm\":\"LLMs\"},\"sale_banner\":{\"ends_in\":\"Ends in\",\"hurry\":\". Hurry!\"},\"hero\":{\"title\":\"Web Scraping API for\",\"role_prefix\":\"\",\"role_suffix\":\"\",\"roles\":[\"Developers\",\"Marketers\",\"Researchers\",\"Data Teams\",\"Product Teams\",\"AI Agents\"],\"subtitle\":\"Get the web data you need for your apps, research, and AI workflows. ScrapeBadger handles proxies, JavaScript rendering, and anti-bot challenges, so you can spend less time maintaining scrapers and more time using the data.\",\"get_started\":\"Get Started Free\",\"view_docs\":\"View Docs\",\"free_credits\":\"{credits} free credits · No credit card required\",\"review_excellent\":\"Excellent\",\"review_on\":\"on\",\"apify_title\":\"Also on Apify Marketplace\",\"apify_stats\":\"31 actors · 2.9K+ users · 97.8% success rate\",\"stats\":{\"uptime\":\"Uptime SLA\",\"response\":\"Avg Response latency\",\"success\":\"Success Rate delivered\"}},\"client_logos\":{\"aria_label\":\"Our clients\",\"title\":\"Trusted for daily data acquisition by\"},\"showcase\":{\"title\":\"See the data [in action]\",\"subtitle\":\"Pick a scraper. This is exactly the JSON it returns.\",\"target_url\":\"Target URL\",\"run_free\":\"Run API for Free\",\"screenshot_alt\":\"{label} page screenshot\",\"explore\":\"Explore {label} →\"},\"how_it_works\":{\"title\":\"Spend less time maintaining scrapers. [Build more.]\",\"subtitle\":\"Get the web data you need while ScrapeBadger handles proxies, browsers, and anti-bot challenges.\",\"steps\":{\"request\":{\"title\":\"Start with a simple request\",\"description\":\"Send your target URL through the API.\"},\"infrastructure\":{\"title\":\"Skip the infrastructure work\",\"description\":\"Leave proxy rotation, JavaScript rendering, and CAPTCHA solving to us.\",\"chips\":[\"proxies\",\"rendering\",\"CAPTCHAs\"]},\"format\":{\"title\":\"Get data in the format you need\",\"description\":\"Choose HTML, Markdown, plain text, or a screenshot.\"}}},\"video\":{\"note_line1\":\"Watch the video to see\",\"note_line2\":\"exactly how it works\",\"title\":\"ScrapeBadger Getting Started: Scrape Twitter, Reddit \u0026 Google in 90 Seconds\"},\"mcp_strip\":{\"lead\":\"Use it from Claude:\",\"body\":\"add our MCP connector and scrape by just asking.\",\"copy\":\"Copy {url}\",\"set_up\":\"Set up MCP\"},\"api_categories\":{\"title\":\"Find the right API for [the type of data you need.]\",\"subtitle\":\"Choose a category to explore the sources and fields available for your workflow.\",\"descriptions\":{\"ecommerce\":\"Product details, prices, offers, and reviews.\",\"social-media\":\"Public posts, profiles, comments, and engagement.\",\"serp\":\"Web results for search and competitor research.\",\"google\":\"Search, Maps, Shopping, News, Trends, and more.\",\"real-estate\":\"Property listings, asking prices, and details.\",\"llm\":\"Generated responses, brand mentions, and citations.\"},\"browse_all\":\"Browse all categories →\",\"sign_up\":\"Sign up\"},\"anti_bot\":{\"title\":\"The Web Fights Back. [We Fight Harder.]\",\"subtitle\":\"Modern websites deploy layers of protection to block scrapers. Building and maintaining your own bypass infrastructure is a full-time job. We do it for you.\",\"challenges\":{\"captchas\":{\"title\":\"CAPTCHAs\",\"description\":\"reCAPTCHA, hCaptcha, Turnstile: invisible and visual challenges that stop automated requests cold.\"},\"wafs\":{\"title\":\"WAFs \u0026 CDNs\",\"description\":\"Web application firewalls fingerprint your requests and block anything that looks non-human.\"},\"fingerprinting\":{\"title\":\"Browser Fingerprinting\",\"description\":\"Sites analyze canvas, WebGL, fonts, and dozens of signals to detect headless browsers.\"},\"behavioral\":{\"title\":\"AI Behavioral Detection\",\"description\":\"Machine learning models analyze mouse movements, timing patterns, and navigation behavior.\"}},\"solution_title\":\"ScrapeBadger handles all of this automatically\",\"solution_body\":\"Send a URL, get clean structured content. No proxy setup, no CAPTCHA solving, no browser management.\",\"solution_points\":[\"Residential proxy rotation across 150+ countries\",\"Real browser sessions with human-like fingerprints\",\"Automatic CAPTCHA solving and challenge bypass\",\"Smart engine escalation when sites fight back\",\"AI-powered data extraction from any page\",\"Clean output in HTML, Markdown, or plain text\"]},\"anti_bot_systems\":{\"title\":\"Built to bypass the toughest [anti-bot systems]\",\"subtitle\":\"Modern websites deploy sophisticated bot detection that silently blocks scrapers without returning an error. ScrapeBadger's auto-escalation engine identifies which protection a target uses and selects the right bypass method. You configure nothing.\",\"read_more_aria\":\"Read more about bypassing {name}\",\"read_more\":\"Read more →\",\"systems\":{\"cloudflare\":\"Cloudflare protects a large portion of the web with browser challenges, JS fingerprinting, and Turnstile CAPTCHAs. ScrapeBadger bypasses Cloudflare's bot management including under-attack mode, challenge pages, and the newest WAF rules, without requiring any configuration from you.\",\"datadome\":\"DataDome uses real-time behavioral analysis and device fingerprinting to block automated requests. It's common on fashion, retail, and media sites. ScrapeBadger passes DataDome's behavioral checks by emulating real browser interaction patterns, HTTP headers, and TLS fingerprints.\",\"akamai\":\"Akamai Bot Manager is deployed by banks, airlines, and large enterprises. It uses JavaScript sensor data collection and behavioral scoring to detect automation. ScrapeBadger handles Akamai's sensor challenges and maintains consistent browser identity across requests to avoid triggering risk scores.\",\"imperva\":\"Imperva (formerly Incapsula) combines IP reputation, cookie challenges, and JavaScript fingerprinting. It's widely used on financial and government sites. ScrapeBadger passes Imperva's cookie-based challenges and IP scoring by routing through clean residential IPs with valid browser profiles.\",\"perimeterx\":\"PerimeterX (now HUMAN Security) scores every request in real time using mouse movements, timing data, and browser telemetry. ScrapeBadger's stealth browser generates realistic interaction patterns and telemetry that pass PerimeterX's risk scoring without triggering blocks or CAPTCHAs.\",\"kasada\":\"Kasada is used by high-security platforms including ticketing sites and sneaker retailers. It deploys cryptographic interrogation that detects automation at the TLS handshake level. ScrapeBadger overcomes Kasada's client-side challenges using a fully instrumented browser environment that passes all interrogation checks.\"},\"footer\":\"ScrapeBadger continuously monitors and updates bypass methods as detection systems evolve. When a protection changes, our infrastructure adapts, and your scraping jobs keep running without any changes on your end.\"},\"testimonials\":{\"title\":\"Trusted by [developers]\",\"rated\":\"Rated {rating}/5 across {count} reviews on Trustpilot, Capterra and Apify.\",\"read_all\":\"Read all reviews\"},\"work_tabs\":{\"title\":\"Put web data to work. [Your way.]\",\"subtitle\":\"Ask your AI agent, build with code, automate a workflow, or run a terminal command. Get web data in the tools you already use.\",\"tabs\":{\"ai\":{\"label\":\"AI agents\",\"title\":\"Give your AI agent the web data it needs.\",\"body\":\"Connect ScrapeBadger to Claude, Cursor, or another compatible AI tool through MCP. Then ask it to find posts, look up products, or scrape pages — in plain English.\",\"cta\":\"Connect your AI agent\",\"support\":\"Uses your ScrapeBadger credits. No extra ScrapeBadger fee for MCP.\"},\"code\":{\"label\":\"Code\",\"title\":\"Build your product. Skip the scraper upkeep.\",\"body\":\"Bring web data into your app with an official SDK or a REST API call. ScrapeBadger handles proxies, browser rendering, and anti-bot challenges behind the scenes.\",\"cta\":\"Explore SDKs and examples\",\"support\":\"Python, Node.js, and more. Connect directly through REST, too.\"},\"nocode\":{\"label\":\"No-code automation\",\"title\":\"Turn web data into automatic updates.\",\"body\":\"Use Make or n8n to collect data from ScrapeBadger and pass it to your next workflow step. Update spreadsheets, send alerts, or feed other tools without writing a script.\",\"cta\":\"Explore integrations\",\"support\":\"Connect through an HTTP request step with your ScrapeBadger API key.\"},\"terminal\":{\"label\":\"Terminal\",\"title\":\"Get your data without leaving the terminal.\",\"body\":\"Run searches and scrape pages with the ScrapeBadger CLI. Export results to CSV or JSON, or pipe them into your existing scripts.\",\"cta\":\"Get started with the CLI\",\"support\":\"JSON, CSV, Markdown, and table output.\"}},\"ai_demo\":{\"label\":\"Illustrative demonstration\",\"prompt\":\"Find recent Reddit discussions about customer onboarding. Return the post titles and links.\",\"agent\":\"Agent · called ScrapeBadger MCP\",\"flow_ask\":\"You ask\",\"flow_call\":\"Your agent calls ScrapeBadger\",\"flow_return\":\"Data returns to your agent\"},\"code_demo\":{\"copy\":\"Copy\",\"copied\":\"Copied!\",\"copy_aria\":\"Copy code\"},\"nocode_demo\":{\"label\":\"Example workflow\",\"nodes\":{\"trigger\":{\"title\":\"Scheduled trigger\",\"body\":\"Runs every morning at 9:00\"},\"request\":{\"title\":\"HTTP request → ScrapeBadger API\",\"body\":\"Make's HTTP module with your API key\"},\"output\":{\"title\":\"Update spreadsheet or send alert\",\"body\":\"Pass the data to your next step\"}}},\"terminal_demo\":{\"label\":\"Export trending topics after installing and authenticating the CLI\"}},\"features\":{\"title\":\"Why [ScrapeBadger]?\",\"items\":{\"escalation\":{\"title\":\"Auto-Escalation\",\"description\":\"rnet for speed, patchright for JS-heavy pages. Automatic fallback on blocks.\",\"stat\":\"Smart\"},\"antibot\":{\"title\":\"Anti-Bot Bypass\",\"description\":\"Cloudflare, DataDome, Akamai: detected and handled without configuration.\",\"stat\":\"10+ types\"},\"sessions\":{\"title\":\"Session Persistence\",\"description\":\"Origin-keyed sessions with proxy pinning. Consistent identity per domain.\",\"stat\":\"Stateful\"},\"formats\":{\"title\":\"Multiple Formats\",\"description\":\"HTML, Markdown, plain text, and screenshots. Use the format that fits your pipeline.\",\"stat\":\"4 formats\"},\"retry\":{\"title\":\"Smart Retry\",\"description\":\"Configurable retry on blocking pages with fresh proxies and new fingerprints.\",\"stat\":\"Resilient\"},\"billing\":{\"title\":\"Credit-Based Billing\",\"description\":\"Pay As You Go from $10 or subscribe monthly/annually. Save up to 70% on larger plans.\",\"stat\":\"Flexible\"}}},\"industries\":{\"title\":\"Built for [every industry]\",\"subtitle\":\"From startups to enterprises, ScrapeBadger powers data-driven decisions across every sector that depends on public web data.\",\"items\":{\"ecommerce\":{\"name\":\"E-Commerce\",\"description\":\"Monitor competitor pricing, track inventory changes, and build dynamic repricing pipelines without getting blocked.\"},\"real_estate\":{\"name\":\"Real Estate\",\"description\":\"Extract property listings, pricing history, and market data for automated valuation and investment tools.\"},\"social\":{\"name\":\"Social Media \u0026 News\",\"description\":\"Monitor mentions, track trending topics, and run sentiment analysis on public posts at scale.\",\"chips\":[\"Twitter/X\",\"Reddit\",\"News sites\"]},\"jobs\":{\"name\":\"Job Market \u0026 Recruitment\",\"description\":\"Aggregate listings into a unified pipeline, track hiring trends, and power workforce analytics tools.\"},\"finance\":{\"name\":\"Finance \u0026 Market Data\",\"description\":\"Collect prices, filings, and analyst reports to power trading signals and alternative data products.\",\"chips\":[\"SEC filings\",\"Yahoo Finance\",\"Bloomberg\"]},\"seo\":{\"name\":\"SEO \u0026 SERP Monitoring\",\"description\":\"Track keyword rankings, monitor SERP features, and audit competitors without hitting rate limits.\",\"chips\":[\"Google SERP\",\"Bing\",\"Review sites\"]},\"ai\":{\"name\":\"AI \u0026 LLM Training Data\",\"description\":\"Collect clean Markdown or text from millions of pages to train, fine-tune, or evaluate language models.\",\"chips\":[\"Markdown\",\"Plain text\",\"JSON\"]},\"leads\":{\"name\":\"Lead Generation\",\"description\":\"Build prospect lists from public directories, social profiles, and business listings, at scale.\",\"chips\":[\"Directories\",\"Profiles\",\"Business listings\"]}}},\"proxies\":{\"title\":\"150+ Countries. [Zero Extra Cost.]\",\"subtitle\":\"Every request is automatically routed through our residential proxy network. No configuration needed: just set a country code and we handle the rest.\",\"stats\":{\"countries\":\"Countries\",\"ips\":\"Residential IPs\",\"cost\":\"Extra Cost\"},\"popular\":\"Popular locations\",\"countries\":{\"us\":\"United States\",\"gb\":\"United Kingdom\",\"de\":\"Germany\",\"fr\":\"France\",\"ca\":\"Canada\",\"jp\":\"Japan\",\"au\":\"Australia\",\"br\":\"Brazil\",\"in\":\"India\",\"it\":\"Italy\",\"es\":\"Spain\",\"nl\":\"Netherlands\",\"pl\":\"Poland\",\"sg\":\"Singapore\",\"kr\":\"South Korea\",\"se\":\"Sweden\",\"mx\":\"Mexico\",\"tr\":\"Turkey\",\"ae\":\"UAE\",\"il\":\"Israel\"},\"more\":\"+130 more\",\"features\":{\"rotation\":{\"title\":\"Auto-rotation\",\"body\":\"Fresh IP on every request. No sticky sessions to manage.\"},\"residential\":{\"title\":\"Residential IPs\",\"body\":\"Real residential IPs from ISPs worldwide. Not datacenter.\"},\"geo\":{\"title\":\"Geo-targeting\",\"body\":\"Target by country with a single parameter. ISP and city-level available.\"}}},\"pricing_section\":{\"title\":\"Simple, [transparent pricing]\",\"subtitle\":\"Pay As You Go from $10 or save up to 70% with a monthly/annual subscription. Subscription credits refresh monthly; PAYG credits never expire.\",\"full_details\":\"See full pricing details\"},\"pricing\":{\"monthly\":\"Monthly\",\"annual\":\"Annual\",\"annual_free_one\":\"Get {months} FREE month!\",\"annual_free_other\":\"Get {months} FREE months!\",\"promo_until\":\"until {date}\",\"promo_link\":\"See discounted API prices →\",\"swipe_hint\":\"← swipe to compare plans →\",\"most_popular\":\"Most popular\",\"more_plans\":\"Show higher-volume plans\",\"fewer_plans\":\"Back to the smaller plans\",\"flexible\":\"Flexible\",\"payg_subtitle\":\"from ${amount} · {expiry}\",\"credits_valid\":\"credits valid {months} months\",\"credits_never_expire\":\"credits never expire\",\"no_commitment\":\"no commitment\",\"buy_credits\":\"Buy Credits\",\"per_month\":\"/mo\",\"cheaper_than_payg\":\"{pct}% cheaper than PAYG\",\"credits_per_month\":\"{credits} credits / mo\",\"cta\":{\"sign_up\":\"Sign up\",\"get_started\":\"Get Started\",\"current_plan\":\"Current plan\",\"switch_annual\":\"Switch to annual\",\"switch_monthly\":\"Switch to monthly\",\"downgrade\":\"Downgrade\",\"upgrade\":\"Upgrade\"},\"rows\":{\"api_credits\":\"API Credits\",\"per_1k\":\"Per 1K credits\",\"tier\":\"Tier\",\"tier_tooltip_title\":\"What is a tier?\",\"tier_tooltip\":\"Your tier controls how many API requests you can make per minute. Higher tiers unlock higher throughput: {tiers}.\",\"rate_limit\":\"Rate limit\",\"req_per_min\":\"{rpm} req/min\",\"general_api\":\"General Web Scraping API\",\"dedicated_apis\":\"Dedicated Scraping APIs\",\"available_scrapers\":\"Available scrapers\",\"residential_proxies\":\"Premium residential proxies\",\"anti_bot\":\"Anti-bot bypass\",\"account_manager\":\"Dedicated account manager\",\"priority_support\":\"Priority support\"},\"need_volume_title\":\"Need more volume?\",\"need_volume_body\":\"Custom credit packages, negotiated pricing, SLA guarantee, and a dedicated account manager.\",\"talk_to_sales\":\"Talk to Sales\",\"trust_free_credits\":\"1,000 free credits on signup, no card required\",\"trust_failed_free\":\"Failed requests are never charged\",\"trust_payg_valid\":\"PAYG credits valid {months} months\",\"trust_payg_never\":\"PAYG credits never expire\",\"load_failed\":\"Failed to load plans\",\"sales\":{\"captcha_required\":\"Please complete the captcha verification.\",\"send_failed\":\"Failed to send message — please try again.\",\"thanks\":\"Thanks — we'll be in touch.\",\"reply_time\":\"Our team will reply within 1 business day with a custom proposal.\",\"close\":\"Close\",\"intro\":\"Tell us about your volume needs and we'll come back with a custom quote, SLA, and dedicated account manager.\",\"name\":\"Your name\",\"name_placeholder\":\"Jane Doe\",\"email\":\"Work email\",\"email_placeholder\":\"jane@company.com\",\"need\":\"What do you need?\",\"need_placeholder\":\"e.g. ~50M Twitter searches per month, 99.9% SLA, dedicated AM.\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"send\":\"Send inquiry\"}},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Frequently asked [questions]\",\"subtitle\":\"Everything you need to know about ScrapeBadger's web scraping API.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is a web scraping API?\",\"a\":\"A web scraping API is a service that lets you extract data from any website with a single HTTP request, without building or maintaining your own scraping infrastructure. ScrapeBadger handles proxy rotation, JavaScript rendering, anti-bot bypass, and session management automatically.\"},{\"q\":\"Which anti-bot systems does ScrapeBadger bypass?\",\"a\":\"ScrapeBadger bypasses Cloudflare, DataDome, Akamai Bot Manager, Imperva (Incapsula), PerimeterX, and Kasada automatically. It also solves reCAPTCHA v2 and v3, hCaptcha, and Cloudflare Turnstile.\"},{\"q\":\"How does ScrapeBadger handle JavaScript-heavy websites?\",\"a\":\"ScrapeBadger renders pages in a stealth Chromium browser (Patchright) that passes fingerprinting checks. Set render_js: true in your request to get the fully rendered DOM.\"},{\"q\":\"What output formats does the web scraping API return?\",\"a\":\"ScrapeBadger returns HTML, Markdown, plain text, and screenshot (PNG). Set the format parameter to html, markdown, text, or screenshot.\"},{\"q\":\"How is pricing calculated?\",\"a\":\"ScrapeBadger uses a credit-based model. Pay As You Go from $10 ($0.15 per 1,000 credits; PAYG credits never expire) or save up to 70% with a monthly/annual subscription (Starter, Growth, Pro, Scale, Volume, Max). 1,000 free credits on signup, no credit card required.\"},{\"q\":\"Is web scraping legal?\",\"a\":\"Scraping publicly accessible data is generally considered legal. A 2022 US Ninth Circuit ruling (hiQ v. LinkedIn) affirmed scraping public data does not violate the CFAA. Always check a site's robots.txt and ToS.\"},{\"q\":\"Is there a free trial?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Every new account receives 1,000 free credits on signup with no credit card required.\"}]},\"blog\":{\"title\":\"Latest tutorials [\u0026 updates]\",\"view_all\":\"View all posts\",\"article\":\"Article\",\"english_label\":\"\",\"read_time\":\"{minutes} min read\"},\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Ready to [Start Scraping]?\",\"free_credits\":\"Get {credits} free credits on signup. No credit card required.\",\"free_trial\":\"Start your free trial today. No credit card required.\",\"go_to_dashboard\":\"Go to Dashboard\",\"start_trial\":\"Start Free Trial\",\"view_docs\":\"View Docs\"},\"footer\":{\"about\":\"ScrapeBadger is a web scraping API that handles proxies, anti-bot bypass, and JavaScript rendering, so you can focus on the data.\",\"columns\":{\"product\":\"Product\",\"scrapers\":\"Scrapers\",\"compare\":\"Compare\",\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"learn\":\"Learn web scraping\"},\"product\":{\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"reviews\":\"Reviews\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"whats_new\":\"What's New\",\"docs\":\"Documentation\",\"sdks\":\"SDKs\",\"mcp\":\"MCP Server\",\"cli\":\"CLI\",\"affiliates\":\"Affiliate Program\",\"status\":\"API Status\",\"careers\":\"Careers\"},\"scrapers\":{\"web\":\"Web Scraper\",\"google\":\"Google Scraper APIs\",\"ecommerce\":\"Ecommerce Scraper APIs\",\"twitter\":\"Twitter Scraper\",\"twitter_streams\":\"Twitter Streams\",\"reddit\":\"Reddit Scraper\",\"instagram\":\"Instagram Scraper\",\"vinted\":\"Vinted Scraper\",\"amazon\":\"Amazon Scraper\"},\"compare\":{\"scrapingbee\":\"Alternative to ScrapingBee\",\"scraperapi\":\"Alternative to ScraperAPI\",\"scrapingdog\":\"Alternative to Scrapingdog\",\"scrapfly\":\"Alternative to Scrapfly\",\"all\":\"All alternatives\"},\"legal\":{\"terms\":\"Terms of Service\",\"acceptable-use\":\"Acceptable Use Policy\",\"content-policy\":\"Content Policy\",\"privacy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"cookies\":\"Cookie Policy\",\"dpa\":\"Data Processing Agreement\",\"subprocessors\":\"Sub-processors\",\"refund\":\"Refund Policy\",\"contact\":\"Contact\"},\"learn\":{\"python\":\"Web Scraping with Python\",\"nodejs\":\"Web Scraping with NodeJS\",\"cloudflare\":\"Cloudflare Bypass\",\"datadome\":\"DataDome Bypass\",\"akamai\":\"Akamai Bypass\",\"imperva\":\"Imperva Bypass\",\"perimeterx\":\"PerimeterX Bypass\",\"kasada\":\"Kasada Bypass\"},\"copyright\":\"ScrapeBadger. All rights reserved.\",\"email_support\":\"Email support\",\"language\":\"Language\",\"cookie_settings\":\"Cookie settings\"},\"cookie_banner\":{\"aria_label\":\"Cookie consent\",\"title\":\"Before you continue\",\"body\":\"We use cookies for analytics and to improve your experience. You can change this any time.\",\"policy_link\":\"Read our cookie policy\",\"accept_all\":\"Accept All\",\"reject_all\":\"Reject All\",\"preferences\":\"Preferences\",\"preferences_title\":\"Cookie Preferences\",\"preferences_body\":\"Choose which cookies you allow. Essential cookies cannot be disabled.\",\"essential\":\"Essential\",\"essential_description\":\"Required for authentication and security\",\"functional\":\"Functional\",\"functional_description\":\"Theme preferences and dashboard settings\",\"analytics\":\"Analytics\",\"analytics_description\":\"Usage statistics via PostHog and Google Analytics\",\"names_label\":\"Cookies and storage\",\"toggle_aria\":\"{label} cookies\",\"save\":\"Save Preferences\",\"back\":\"Back\"}},\"children\":\"$L20\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"initialPricing\":{\"free_registration_credits\":1000,\"pricing_plans\":[{\"id\":\"4e8a125f-6c3b-4744-835f-b08765f89cf2\",\"name\":\"Starter\",\"tier\":\"basic\",\"tier_level\":1,\"credits_amount\":100000,\"price_usd\":20,\"description\":\"Perfect for trying out the API - baseline pricing\",\"display_order\":1,\"is_popular\":false},{\"id\":\"af00b8d3-6e4b-45fe-bc87-298a897d25bd\",\"name\":\"Basic\",\"tier\":\"basic\",\"tier_level\":1,\"credits_amount\":200000,\"price_usd\":36,\"description\":\"Save more with little bigger package\",\"display_order\":1,\"is_popular\":false},{\"id\":\"3b514608-2961-4400-8e8d-905a91773931\",\"name\":\"Growth\",\"tier\":\"pro\",\"tier_level\":2,\"credits_amount\":500000,\"price_usd\":80,\"description\":\"For growing projects - 20% savings\",\"display_order\":2,\"is_popular\":false},{\"id\":\"3e92c1aa-b5cb-4a4b-9ea0-f74383bb1b5e\",\"name\":\"Professional\",\"tier\":\"pro\",\"tier_level\":3,\"credits_amount\":2000000,\"price_usd\":240,\"description\":\"For professionals - 40% savings\",\"display_order\":3,\"is_popular\":false},{\"id\":\"8fdb88af-18b2-4099-801e-30f8615577ce\",\"name\":\"Enterprise\",\"tier\":\"enterprise\",\"tier_level\":4,\"credits_amount\":10000000,\"price_usd\":1000,\"description\":\"High volume - 50% savings\",\"display_order\":4,\"is_popular\":false}],\"scraper_costs\":[{\"scraper_name