ael J.\",\"quote\":\"I've tried a few scraping APIs and have been using Scrapebadger lately. So far it's been the least troublesome for me. The API is pretty straightforward and the results have been consistent.\",\"meta\":\"Capterra · 30 September 2026\"},{\"id\":\"bf6d2f77-d1b0-44a2-86b4-c35b1ce6789b\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/scrape.badger/twitter-tweets-scraper/reviews\",\"name\":\"indigo_verity\",\"quote\":\"really love the product. Great data quality and fast speed. Strange that the rating is so low. Highly recommend\",\"meta\":\"Apify · 3 September 2026\"},{\"id\":\"89778772-c024-4af7-9440-50b441375fb3\",\"url\":\"https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6ab697660ed18a60a6979cac\",\"name\":\"P Yam\",\"quote\":\"Fantastic service - been using this for over 6 months and hasn't failed me ONCE. They are consistently bringing out new scrapers and the prices are the cheapest ive seen on the market. Definitely recommended!\",\"meta\":\"Trustpilot · United Kingdom · 25 September 2026\"}]}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"18:null\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1c:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"ScrapeBadger | Scrape Any Website - Web Scraping API\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Scrape any website and get clean HTML, Markdown, or screenshots. Auto-escalation, anti-bot bypass, and no IP blocks. Get 1,000 free credits on signup.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://scrapebadger.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"ScrapeBadger\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/site.webmanifest\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"web scraping API,website scraper,anti-bot bypass,web scraping service,HTML scraper,Markdown scraper,screenshot API,data extraction API,Twitter API,social media scraping,web crawler,no blocks scraping,Cloudflare bypass\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"creato